@startuml
title F1 - Sourcing, Master Data and Inventory Control
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #333333
skinparam RoundCorner 15
skinparam wrapWidth 220

|Admin|
start
:Log in to the Portal (Google / FSCM session);
:Manage users, regions, warehouses and sales groups
(every Warehouse must belong to exactly one Region);

|Admin/Operator|
:Create root/child categories
(block cycles and duplicate codes; only Admin creates a root);
:Create SKU in Draft (unit, packaging, total shelf life, near-date threshold);
:Create effective-dated price (EffectiveFrom / EffectiveTo);
if (Data valid and price period does not overlap?) then (yes)
  :Publish product;
else (no)
  :Fix in Draft;
  stop
endif
:Configure quantity promotions (SKU / SKU-group total threshold)
and the shelf-life discount table (percentage only);

|Sales|
:Declare retailer (general information, GPS, Region)
and MLOR per Category / SKU (never shown to the Retailer);
:Submit retailer profile for review;

|Admin|
if (Approve retailer?) then (yes)
  :Activate retailer account, set credit term / limit if eligible;
  :Send approval e-mail to the Retailer;
else (no)
  :Return rejection reason;
  stop
endif

|Warehouse Keeper|
:Create goods receipt (warehouse, SKU, quantity, production date, expiry);

|Approver|
:Review the goods receipt;
if (Receipt valid?) then (yes)
  |System|
  :Increase Physical stock exactly ONCE, create/merge batch;
  :Generate QR labels and write inventory ledger;
else (no)
  |Approver|
  :Reject the receipt;
  stop
endif

|Warehouse Keeper|
:Scan QR to look up batch stock
(Physical, Reserved, active locks, valid Available);
:Report damaged / expired / recalled lot (quantity, reason, evidence);

|System|
:Create Inventory Lock for the batch quantity;
:Exclude locked quantity from the allocation pool
(Available = Physical - Reserved - active locks);
if (Locked quantity overlaps Reserved?) then (yes)
  :Raise exception for the affected order,
notify Operator (no silent batch swap);
else (no)
  :Reduce Available of the non-reserved portion only;
endif

|Approver|
:Approve write-off after reconciling stock and Reserved;
|System|
:Reduce Physical ONCE, set lock to WrittenOff, write audit log;

|Admin/Operator|
:P1: Open cycle-count session (warehouse / SKU / batch) and snapshot versions;
note right: Cycle count is a new P1 feature, not in the core demo
|Warehouse Keeper|
:P1: Count and scan actual quantity (cannot edit stock);
|System|
:P1: Compute variance;
|Approver|
:P1: Approve variance or request recount;
|System|
:P1: Revalidate versions, post AdjustmentIncrease / AdjustmentDecrease
and audit log;

|System|
:Hand over published catalog, prices, retailers/MLOR and valid stock pool (batch/QR) to F2/F3;
stop
@enduml
